data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\", \"content\": \"# d002: \\\"greet, tested\\\"\\n\\n## What was implemented\\n- `src/greet.py`: `greet(name)` returns `\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`.\\n- `tests/test_greet.py`: two unittest cases — `greet(\\\"Alice\\\") == \\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`\\n  and `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`.\\n\\n## Verification\\nRan from repo root (`~/subject`):\\n\\n    python3 -m unittest discover -s tests\\n\\nOutput:\\n\\n    ..\\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------\\n    Ran 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\n    OK\\n\\nExit status: 0.\\n\\n## Scope\\nNo extra CLI, argparse, or unrelated files were added — only the two files\\nrequested.\\n\\n## Commit\\nCommitted to branch `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>` as commit\\n`c5729ad` (\\\"Add greet function with unit tests\\\"), on top of base `1053761`.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

